window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In the shadows of a world teetering on the edge of darkness, <i>The Hollow Thirst</i> follows a desperate journey of survival, love, and transformation. Alistair, a man cursed with a bloodline bound to the night, grapples with his humanity as a dangerous force grows within him—a thirst for power, for freedom, and for the forbidden.</p> <p>As he navigates a world of secret societies, ancient rituals, and the haunting pull of the bloodveil, Alistair must confront the truth about the cost of immortality and what it means to truly be free. Will he succumb to the allure of darkness, or can he find redemption before the hunger consumes him entirely?</p> <p>Poetic, intense, and packed with suspense, <i>The Hollow Thirst</i> will take listeners on an emotional ride through the underworld of vampires, power, and self-discovery. A tale of the eternal battle between light and darkness, love and sacrifice, <i>The Hollow Thirst</i> is the first chapter in a saga that will haunt you long after the final word.</p>"; 
